  unitName: Soul Keeper Lemia
  unitId: 60164
  unitNumber: 238
  description: "A sorceress specializing in necromancy. Lemia\u2019s activities incurred
    the wrath of Death God Lodaga, who criticized her for meddling in the affairs
    of his world. When Lemia refused to stop, a power struggle ensued between her
    and Lodaga for the right to control the souls of the dead. The struggle ended
    up lasting until Lemia, herself, was no more, though it\u2019s said that the
    tormented voices of souls she once commanded can still be heard to this day."
  summonDesc: You need of me, even though<br>I've already succumbed to darkness?<br>So
    be it. I offer you my all...
  fusionDesc: "Hehe...<br>Yes... Yes, that\u2019s it...<br>Now, I can be me..."
  evoDesc: The power to control the dead...<br>It is yours if you so desire...<br>I
    have no need of it anymore...
